  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Monitoring for Environment and Security and Africa (GMES &amp; Africa) - Phase 2 Contribution Agreement with AUC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action, to be implemented by the AUC, will set up, through African thematic, scientific and academic networks and in cooperation with European partners, an African Water &amp; Natural Resources Service and an African Marine &amp;amp; Coastal Service. It aims at helping all of Africa benefit from being able to receive and process and use EO and geo-data; and notably from making EO-based information (applications and services) available to policy- and decision- makers at different levels.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
